#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:3 3af2d357f5af4fb39df8f2dcd99b5454
msgid ""
"Sailing functionality must first be enabled by setting :ref:`SAIL_ENABLE "
"<SAIL_ENABLE>` to 1 and re-booting."
msgstr "帆船功能必须先通过将 :ref:`SAIL_ENABLE <SAIL_ENABLE>` 设为 1 并重新启动来启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:7 a41176c6e18b45a595f463c1262eca6a
msgid "Hardware Setup"
msgstr "硬件设置"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:9 45013513285749ac9c0463d3a94f9cfb
msgid ""
"Sailing vehicles require a rudder for boats or movable wheel(s) for land "
"vehicles. This is setup in the normal way by assigning a servo output "
"channel, ``SERVOx_FUNCTION``, to function 26 (Ground Steering)."
msgstr ""
"帆船需要船用舵（或陆地车辆的可移动轮）。通过将舵机输出通道 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 分配为功能 26（地面转向）按常规方式设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:11 c35b79176d1440c286780281daaf5b8c
msgid ""
"Although not absolutely required for best results a wind vane should be "
"fitted to allow the vehicle to sense the wind direction. See :ref:`wind-"
"vane`. If a wind vane sensor is not used, then assumed wind direction must "
"be input using these methods: :ref:`wind-vane-home-heading`."
msgstr ""
"虽然不是绝对必要，但为获得最佳效果，应安装风速传感器以让车辆感知风向。参见 :ref:`wind-"
"vane`。若不使用风速传感器，则必须使用以下方式输入假定风向：:ref:`wind-vane-home-heading`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:14 db6736459ff343ccab7adf0f528f296c
msgid ""
"A further improvement can be gained by fitting a wind speed sensor, the "
"faster your vehicle goes relative to the wind speed the more important this "
"is. See :ref:`wind-vane`."
msgstr "安装风速传感器可进一步提升性能，车辆速度相对风速越快，此传感器的重要性越高。参见 :ref:`wind-vane`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:20 0d9f681e532c4775890861730c42eaac
msgid ""
"Sailing vehicles also require a method of controlling the sails. There are "
"three supported actuator types, all actuators on a single vehicle should be "
"of the same type."
msgstr "帆船还需要控制帆的方式。支持三种执行器类型，单一车辆上的所有执行器应为同一类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:24 a717bffcf3ba45dc956db4c0488f4dbc
msgid "Sail winch"
msgstr "帆面绞盘"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:25 7515c42a09f94d91b24ea9a3c77b00e0
msgid ""
"The servo must pull in and let out the sails in a symmetrical way. I.e. no "
"change of servo position should be required to set the sails at the same "
"angle on a new tack. This is typically achieved through the use of a sail "
"winch servo with a main sheet system. The sail winch is servo output "
"function, ``SERVOx_FUNCTION``, 89 - Main Sail."
msgstr ""
"舵机必须以对称方式收帆和放帆，即换舷时无需改变舵机位置即可将帆设置到相同角度。这通常通过帆面绞盘舵机配合主帆控制系统实现。帆面绞盘的舵机输出功能 "
"``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 为 89（主帆）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:28 0e6b2a547ab64536a879258ca6d739c7
msgid ""
"When using a sail winch the sail limits angle must be configured. This can "
"be tested by arming in manual mode; the throttle will directly control the "
"sail position. Throttle stick down (towards you) should result in the sail "
"being sheeted in towards the centre line. If the sail is sheeted out the "
"servo should be reversed. The servo min and max parameters can then be used "
"to set up the range of travel. The min and max values should be set such "
"that the boom is brought in towards the centre line of the boat but not "
"pulled down tightly. The boom should be able to be let out until it reaches "
"the shrouds; if no shrouds are fitted the boom shouldn’t go too far past 90 "
"degrees to the boat centre line."
msgstr ""
"使用帆面绞盘时，必须配置帆角限制。可通过在手动模式下解锁来测试：油门将直接控制帆位。油门杆向下（朝向自己）应使帆收向中心线。若帆放出，应反转舵机。然后可使用舵机最小和最大参数设置行程范围。最小和最大值应使横桁收至船中心线附近但不拉紧。横桁应能放出直至到达支索；若无支索，横桁不应超过船中心线"
" 90 度太多。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:37 749ee8a2e51d428799589a30e19f15a9
msgid ""
"The sail angle :ref:`SAIL_ANGLE_MIN<SAIL_ANGLE_MIN>` and "
":ref:`SAIL_ANGLE_MAX<SAIL_ANGLE_MAX>` parameters should be set to the angle "
"to boom is to the centre line at each extreme of its travel. This allows the"
" angle of the boom to be calculated at any point between."
msgstr ""
"帆角参数 :ref:`SAIL_ANGLE_MIN<SAIL_ANGLE_MIN>` 和 "
":ref:`SAIL_ANGLE_MAX<SAIL_ANGLE_MAX>` "
"应设为横桁在行程两端时相对于中心线的角度，这样可以计算出任意中间位置的横桁角度。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:41 d5104e4a1e444af69fb59c29882eeb68
msgid ""
"The ideal sail angle to the wind :ref:`(SAIL_ANGLE_IDEAL)<SAIL_ANGLE_IDEAL>`"
" should then be set. This defines the angle between the boom and the wind "
"direction as reported by the wind vane. An angle of zero here would result "
"in the boom staying parallel to the wind vane. The boom will keep this angle"
" to the wind until it reaches either its minimum or maximum limit. If the "
"sails are too loose this number should be increased. This can be tested in "
"ACRO mode."
msgstr ""
"然后应设置帆的理想迎风角度 "
":ref:`(SAIL_ANGLE_IDEAL)<SAIL_ANGLE_IDEAL>`。这定义了横桁与风速传感器报告的风向之间的角度。此角度为零将使横桁保持与风速传感器平行。横桁将保持此迎风角度直到达到最小或最大限值。若帆太松，应增大此值。可在"
" Acro 模式下测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:48 13750660612e42eba07ae20fd69ef9fd
msgid "Wing sail elevator"
msgstr "翼帆升降舵"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:49 e8be5e35c908464aa39c64203125a18c
msgid ""
"A wing sail may be actuated by a secondary control surface akin to a plane's"
" elevator, the wing is free to rotate on a mast and actuated only by the "
"control surface. This should be setup such that the servo mid point "
"(``SERVOx_TRIM``) results in zero angle of attack on the main wing. See "
"`Karl's build <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/sailboat-"
"support/32060/321>`__ . Use servo output function, ``SERVOx_FUNCTION``, 128 "
"- Wing Sail Elevator."
msgstr ""
"翼帆可由类似飞机升降舵的辅助操纵面驱动，翼帆可绕桅杆自由旋转，仅由操纵面驱动。应设置舵机中点（``SERVOx_TRIM``）使主翼的攻角为零。参见 "
"`Karl 的构建 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/sailboat-"
"support/32060/321>`__。使用舵机输出功能 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 128（翼帆升降舵）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:52 8f6160ddd2fe4fa09867d7f2a52ba58e
msgid ""
"The servo min (``SERVOx_MIN``) and max (``SERVOx_MAX``) end points should be"
" set such that the main wing is held in a maximum lift angle of attack on "
"both tacks. If the wing sail is acting on the wrong tack the servo should be"
" reversed with ``SERVOx_REVERSE``. The `SAIL_ANGLE_*` parameters are not use"
" with wing sail elevators."
msgstr ""
"舵机最小值（``SERVOx_MIN``）和最大值（``SERVOx_MAX``）端点应设置为使主翼在两个换舷时均保持最大升力攻角。若翼帆在错误的换舷方向工作，应使用"
" ``SERVOx_REVERSE`` 反转舵机。`SAIL_ANGLE_*` 参数不适用于翼帆升降舵。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:56 07b2406093ef4ef997e5dd6323242ed4
msgid "Direct wing sail actuation"
msgstr "翼帆直接驱动"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:57 abc274ec312448bfa7c2207a6029ad06
msgid ""
"Wing sail is directly driven by a servo, in this case use servo output "
"function, ``SERVOx_FUNCTION``, 137 - Sail Mast Rotation. See `Ari's build "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/pull/17066#issuecomment-813692335>`__"
msgstr ""
"翼帆由舵机直接驱动，此时使用舵机输出功能 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 137（帆桅旋转）。参见 `Ari 的构建 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/pull/17066#issuecomment-813692335>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:59 48c9438376424150a8b70cb042a0a742
msgid ""
"The servo mid point (``SERVOx_TRIM``) must be set such such that the wing is"
" held on the center line of the boat. The min (``SERVOx_MIN``) and max "
"points (``SERVOx_MAX``) should be set such that the wing moves to the same "
"angle on each tack. This maximum angle should be measured and set to the "
":ref:`SAIL_ANGLE_MAX<SAIL_ANGLE_MAX>` parameter. For best results this "
"should be close to 90 deg. As with sheeted sails "
":ref:`SAIL_ANGLE_IDEAL<SAIL_ANGLE_IDEAL>` controls the angle the wing is "
"held to the wind. There is not such visual feedback for under and over "
"sheeting as there is with a soft sail so some testing might be required to "
"find the best value."
msgstr ""
"舵机中点（``SERVOx_TRIM``）必须设置为使翼帆保持在船中心线上。最小值（``SERVOx_MIN``）和最大值（``SERVOx_MAX``）应设置为翼帆在两侧换舷时移动到相同角度。此最大角度应测量后设置到"
" :ref:`SAIL_ANGLE_MAX<SAIL_ANGLE_MAX>` 参数中，最佳效果接近 90 "
"度。与帆控系统一样，:ref:`SAIL_ANGLE_IDEAL<SAIL_ANGLE_IDEAL>` "
"控制翼帆对风保持的角度。由于翼帆没有像软帆那样可见的收放过紧或过松的视觉反馈，可能需要一些测试才能找到最佳值。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:63 86480c959746462aba2d55f8f6262224
msgid ""
"Note that to stop the wing sail will be moved to the center line of the boat"
" rather than actively driven to point into the wind."
msgstr "注意停止时翼帆将移至船中心线，而不是主动对准迎风方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:66 4e463a8e98904bc5b679567c864d252f
msgid "Motoring"
msgstr "动力驾驶"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:67 c3bad1580a63491e9525f74f943aa00b
msgid ""
"Sailboat also supports motoring, this can be user selected or based on a "
"wind speed threshold. The motor can take any form and should be setup as it "
"would be for a normal rover. In this case the throttle stick will control "
"both the motor and the sail. To avoid this conflict sail control can be set "
"to a second RC input channel by setting a `RCx_OPTION` to 207 - Mainsail. "
"The secondary channel will only be active in modes where the operator has "
"direct manual control of the sail, in 'higher' control modes the main "
"throttle channel will still be used."
msgstr ""
"帆船也支持动力驾驶，可由用户选择或根据风速阈值自动切换。电机可采用任何形式，应按普通 Rover "
"方式设置。此时油门杆将同时控制电机和帆。为避免此冲突，可将第二个 RC 输入通道设置为帆控，方法是将 `RCx_OPTION` 设为 "
"207（主帆）。第二通道仅在操作员直接手动控制帆的模式下有效，在「高级」控制模式下仍使用主油门通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:71 d6c3cce175f14d7ea8e2b974bd0e15f4
msgid ""
"If configured with both a motor and sail the vehicle will automatically "
"switch based on the conditions. :ref:`SAIL_WNDSPD_MIN<SAIL_WNDSPD_MIN>` "
"defines the wind speed threshold, in winds above this speed the vehicle will"
" sail tacking to its destination if required. When the wind speed decrees "
"below that threshold the vehicle will drive to its destination on a direct "
"path as a normal Rover would. If the vehicle gets stuck while trying to tack"
" it will also use its throttle to try and complete the tack."
msgstr ""
"若同时配置了电机和帆，车辆将根据条件自动切换。:ref:`SAIL_WNDSPD_MIN<SAIL_WNDSPD_MIN>` "
"定义风速阈值，当风速高于此阈值时，车辆将使用帆驶向目的地（必要时抢风换舷）。当风速低于阈值时，车辆将像普通 Rover "
"一样直接驶向目的地。若车辆在抢风换舷时卡住，也会使用油门尝试完成换舷。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:75 0e24917f1036415eb7f688eedcdbef4c
msgid ""
"`RCx_OPTION`  74 - Sailboat motoring 3pos allows the operator to control the"
" motoring states. The low position the motor is disabled, the vehicle will "
"always try to sail. The middle position is the default automatic switching "
"as explained above. The switch high position is motoring only, the vehicle "
"will always use the motor and never try to sail."
msgstr ""
"`RCx_OPTION` "
"74（帆船动力驾驶三挡）允许操作员控制动力驾驶状态。低位时电机禁用，车辆始终尝试使用帆驾驶。中位是默认的自动切换模式（如上所述）。高位时仅使用动力驾驶，车辆始终使用电机，不尝试使用帆。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-hardware.rst:79 b235616863cb4b0f88ce05d5871252bd
msgid ""
"when sailing there is no speed control, the vehicle is trying to sail or it "
"releases the sail and tries to stop. When motoring speed control works as "
"normal."
msgstr "使用帆驾驶时没有速度控制，车辆要么尝试使用帆航行，要么放帆尝试停止。动力驾驶时速度控制正常工作。"
